  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "•\tLarge private pool, outdoor TV, ample seating, all surrounded by a privacy fence<br>•\tGolf Cart - Huge Savings! Add the Streat Legal Golf Cart - 10% Discount off Cart Rate<br>•\tBikes!<br>•\tGulf views<br>•\tClose to beach access!<br>•\tOverlooks 30A!<br>•\tMultiple balconies<br>•\tPrime 30A location<br>•\tFully stocked kitchen for all your culinary needs<br>•\tOpen-concept living area perfect for gatherings<br>•\tFour backpack beach chairs and a beach umbrella included<br>•\tFree Wi-Fi throughout the home<br>•\tConveniently close to dining, shopping, and entertainment<br>•\tThoughtfully stocked with a Starbucks coffee pack, creamer, sugar, bottled water, and a starter amenity package, including essentials like paper towels, dish soap, laundry pods, and bathroom toiletries.<br><br>Welcome to Dune Daze – Your perfect 30A vacation rental! Located in the heart of Dune Allen Beach on 30A, this luxury vacation rental is a charming 5-bedroom, 4-bathroom beach house designed for relaxation and fun. Just steps from the pristine white sands, this 30A vacation rental sleeps 16 guests and is ideal for families and groups seeking a peaceful yet exciting retreat.<br><br>Enjoy easy access to the Dune Allen Beach public entrance, with a quick stroll or bike ride to local favorites like Stinky’s Fish Camp, Shunk Gulley, and Gulf Place, a lively dining and shopping hub. With direct access to the 30A bike path, exploring the scenic coastline is a breeze.<br><br>Upon arrival, you'll be greeted by a private pool with a privacy fence, perfect for cooling off after a day at the beach. Grill poolside on the gas BBQ or grab a refreshing drink from the nearby refrigerator. Whether you're watching the sunset from the wrap-around balcony or relaxing by the pool, every outdoor moment feels like paradise.<br><br>The main living area on the third floor features an open-concept kitchen, dining, and living room with breathtaking Gulf views. With stainless steel appliances, a large breakfast bar, and multiple dining areas, it’s the ideal space for gathering and sharing meals. Also on the third floor is a queen-over-queen bunk room, perfect for kids or extra guests.<br><br>On the second level, you'll find three well-appointed bedrooms: another queen-over-queen bunk room with individual flat-screen TVs, a queen bedroom with balcony access, and a spacious king suite with a sleeper sofa, en-suite bathroom, and private balcony.<br><br>The fourth-floor bedroom is a private haven, complete with wrap-around balcony views, a full en-suite bathroom, and a wet bar with a mini-fridge and coffee maker. It's the perfect spot to enjoy the sunrise or sunset in complete serenity.<br><br>Whether you’re planning a family vacation or a friends’ reunion, Dune Daze has everything you need for an unforgettable stay. Book your stay today and start creating lasting memories at this incredible 30A beach retreat.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
